Package: funstruct
Type: Package
Title: Functional Structure in Trait Spaces
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Carlos P.", "Carmona",
           email = "perezcarmonacarlos@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6935-4913")))
Description: A unified workflow for trait-based ecology: build trait spaces
    (principal component analysis, principal coordinates analysis,
    non-metric multidimensional scaling), evaluate their quality and
    dimensionality, estimate functional structure using trait probability
    densities (TPD) and classical indices, and partition functional
    diversity across nested scales using Rao, Hill-Chao and TPD-based
    equivalent numbers. Supersedes and extends the 'TPD' and 'funspace'
    packages.
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/CarlosP-Carmona/funstruct
